[en.DECISION_C02_C08_PRESSURE]
Pressure the Resistance

[en.DECISION_C02_C08_PRESSURE_desc]
The Empire has asked us to send troops to pressure the Resistance. No matter what we actually want to do, we should at least make a show of it.

[zh.DECISION_C02_C08_PRESSURE]
向抵抗军施压

[zh.DECISION_C02_C08_PRESSURE_desc]
帝国已经要求我们派遣军队向抵抗军施压。无论我们实际上想做什么，至少我们应该做个样子。
